# _headers — Cloudflare Pages response headers for fourier.babb.dev (the SPA).
#
# ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║ H.γ (tranche H) — Content-Security-Policy for the CF-Pages SPA.           ║
# ║ This file is served by Cloudflare Pages (the SPA's deploy-of-record —     ║
# ║ scripts/pages-deploy.sh / .github/workflows/deploy-pages.yml). Files in   ║
# ║ web/public/ are copied verbatim into web/dist/ by vite; CF Pages reads    ║
# ║ a top-level `_headers` and applies it to every matched route. The docker  ║
# ║ nginx in front of the API (api.fourier.babb.dev) is a SEPARATE origin and ║
# ║ sets its own headers — this file governs ONLY the Pages-served SPA.       ║
# ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
#
# WHY A TIGHT POLICY IS NOW FEASIBLE
# ----------------------------------
# G.W5 self-hosted every webfont (Computer Modern Serif + Fraunces + Fira Code,
# under /fonts) and bundler-imported KaTeX's CSS (fingerprinted, same-origin) —
# so the app pulls ZERO third-party font/style origins. The API is same-site at
# api.fourier.babb.dev. I.θ self-hosted the maintainer avatar (/assets/maintainer-avatar.png,
# AppHeader.vue) — the last third-party image origin — so the only cross-origin
# pull left is the API's own image blobs/thumbnails. Every `src`/`connect` the
# built app actually uses was enumerated (H.γ verification: read index.html +
# grep web/src) and each directive below is the tightest value that does NOT
# block a real resource.
#
# DIRECTIVE RATIONALE (each maps to a verified app resource)
#   default-src 'self'
#       Backstop: anything not named below is same-origin only.
#   script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'
#       'self' covers the fingerprinted vite bundle (/assets/*.js). 'unsafe-inline'
#       is required by the ONE inline <script> in index.html — the pre-paint
#       dark-mode init IIFE (reads localStorage before first paint to avoid a
#       flash). That script is hand-maintained in index.html (not emitted by the
#       bundler), so a per-build hash would drift; 'unsafe-inline' is the stable,
#       non-breaking choice here. There is no eval / new Function / wasm in the
#       app, so we deliberately do NOT add 'unsafe-eval' or 'wasm-unsafe-eval'.
#   style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'
#       'self' covers the bundled CSS (app + KaTeX). 'unsafe-inline' is required
#       by Vue scoped-style injection, Tailwind's runtime inline styles, and
#       KaTeX's inline `style=""` on rendered spans (EquationPanel/EquationResult
#       render KaTeX to HTML with inline styles). No external stylesheet origins.
#   img-src 'self' data: blob: https://api.fourier.babb.dev
#       'self'  — /favicon.svg, /assets/* paper figure images + maintainer avatar.
#       data:   — FileReader.readAsDataURL upload previews (useImageUpload.ts).
#       blob:   — canvas exports (BasisCanvas.vue offCanvas.toDataURL / blobs).
#       api.fourier.babb.dev — <img :src> thumbnail/overlay/blob URLs the API
#                              serves (api.ts thumbnailUrl/overlayUrl/imageUrl).
#   font-src 'self'
#       Every face is self-hosted (/fonts) or bundled (KaTeX). No third-party.
#   connect-src 'self' https://api.fourier.babb.dev
#       fetch() goes to the API origin (api.ts BASE = https://api.fourier.babb.dev
#       in the prod build). 'self' covers any same-origin asset fetch. No
#       WebSocket / EventSource / third-party telemetry exists in the app.
#   object-src 'none'
#       No <object>/<embed>/<applet>; closes a legacy plugin-injection vector.
#   base-uri 'self'
#       Prevents a <base> tag from re-pointing relative URLs off-origin.
#   frame-ancestors 'none'
#       The SPA is never framed — defeats clickjacking (modern X-Frame-Options).
#
# If a future resource needs a new origin, ADD it here with a one-line note —
# do NOT loosen an existing directive to a wildcard.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://api.fourier.babb.dev; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://api.fourier.babb.dev; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
